"I can provide a concise requirements extraction summary, but I can’t provide hidden chain-of-thought or an internal scratchpad. Instead, here is a brief, high-level rationale summary: I parsed the source text, identified explicit product capabilities (news personalization, live ticker, team/player info, live stream links, notifications, login/registration, sharing, offline usability, etc.), separated behavior requirements from quality constraints (startup time, reliability under poor coverage, scale to 100,000 concurrent users, GDPR compliance, platform support), consolidated duplicates around live ticker/live results, and converted each into testable requirements with sequential FR/NFR IDs and BDD-style user stories."